    "description": {
      "chat": "",
      "gmnotes": "",
      "short": "",
      "unidentified": "",
      "value": "<p>You touch a willing creature with at least one manifestation from corruption and expend 2 Resolve Points. If you do so, you temporarily gain any stains and gifts that corruption grants to the target, and the target retains them. If a gift you gain has limited uses, you can use the gift only by expending 1 Resolve Point for each use.</p>"
